# DonPapi LED stills (always)

When generating or editing DonPapi / ShoutOut LED photos:

1. **64×32 cm** — bezeless (pixels to the edge, no black frame). **One person.** Carried **above the head** (arms extended up). Never chest-height. Never two people.
2. **96×64 cm** — **only** size two people carry, also **above both heads**.
3. **>45 characters** of ShoutOut copy → tall **non-VIP standing** portrait board (Maya Happy Birthday floor pillar). Not carried. Not a tombstone on a metal stand.
4. Footer on the LED, exactly: **Powered by DonPapi and Social OS**
5. Short copy stays on carried panels: “Ridin' Rari”; “Happy B-Day to my gorgeous Wife D'”; use 👏 / 🐱 not the words Clapping/Kitty.
6. Multiple stills per temp club (approach / mid / table) so an external video renderer can animate. This environment does not output video files.

Overwrite the canonical `images/temp-qa` DonPapi files and wire `floqr-temp-qa-showcase.js` + `temp-qa-images-preview.html`.
